L["All spell criticals against you cause 15% of the damage taken to the caster as well. The damage caused by Eye for an Eye will not exceed 50% of the Paladin's total health."] = "所有對你造成致命一擊的法術都會對其施法者造成15%的傷害，但最大數值不會超過聖騎士生命力總量的50%。"
