L["Assault the target's mind with Shadow energy, causing 75 Shadow damage over 3 sec and slowing their movement speed by 50%."] = "以暗影能量攻擊目標的靈魂，在3秒內對其造成總計75點暗影傷害，並使其移動速度降低50%。"
