L["Reduces threat caused by Tranquility by 50%."] = "使你的寧靜法術導致的威脅值降低50%。"
L["Reduces your target's chance to resist your Shadow spells by 2%."] = "使目標抵抗你的暗影法術的機率下降2%。"
L["Reduces your target's resistance to all your spells by 5 and reduces the threat caused by your Arcane spells by 20%."] = "使目標對你所有法術的抗性降低5點和你的秘法法術所產生的威脅值降低20%。"
L["Regenerates 1% of your total Health over 6 sec after being the victim of a critical strike."] = "在受到致命一擊之後，會在6秒內回復總生命力的1%。"
L["Silences the target, preventing them from casting spells for 5 sec."] = "使目標沉默，在5秒內不能施法。"
L["Stuns the opponent for 5 sec."] = "使目標昏迷5秒。"
L["Summons a Mana Tide Totem with 5 health at the feet of the caster for 12 sec that restores 170 mana every 3 seconds to group members within 20 yards."] = "在施法者身邊召喚一個生命力為5點的法力之潮圖騰，持續12秒。它可以為半徑20碼範圍內的小隊成員每3秒恢復170點法力。"
L["The Berserker Rage ability will generate 5 rage when used."] = "在使用狂暴之怒技能之後獲得5點怒氣。"
L["The enemy target is swarmed by insects, decreasing their chance to hit by 2% and causing 66 Nature damage over 12 sec."] = "敵人被飛蟲圍繞，攻擊命中率降低2%，在12秒內受到總計66點自然傷害。"
L["Transfers 15 health from the target to the caster every 3 sec. Lasts 30 sec."] = "每3秒將目標的15點生命力轉移給施法者，持續30秒。"
L["Upon death, the priest becomes the Spirit of Redemption for 10 sec. The Spirit of Redemption cannot move, attack, be attacked or targeted by any spells or effects. While in this form the priest can cast any healing spell free of cost. When the effect ends, the priest dies."] = "死亡之時，牧師變為救贖之魂，持續10秒。救贖之魂無法移動、攻擊，且不受任何法術或效果攻擊或鎖定。進入此形態，牧師可不消耗能量施放任何治療法術。效果結束後，牧師就會死亡。"
L["When activated, gives your next Flash of Light, Holy Light, or Holy Shock spell a 100% critical effect chance."] = "啟動之後，使你的下一個聖光閃現，聖光術或神聖震擊的治療法術有100%的機率造成極效治療。"
L["When activated, increases the critical strike chance of your next Sinister Strike, Backstab, Ambush, or Eviscerate by 100%."] = "啟動之後，你的下一次邪惡攻擊、背刺、伏擊或剔骨造成致命一擊的機率提高100%。"
L["When activated, increases your physical damage by 20% and makes you immune to Fear effects, but lowers your armor and all resistances by 20%. Lasts 30 sec."] = "啟動之後，你的物理攻擊傷害提高20%，並免疫恐懼效果，但是對所有攻擊的防禦力都降低20%。持續30秒。"
L["When activated, reduces the Mana cost of your next spell by 100% and increases its critical effect chance by 25% if it is capable of a critical effect."] = "啟動之後，使你的下一個法術所消耗的法力減少100%，造成致命一擊的機率提高25%（如果它有可能造成這些效果的話）。"
L["When activated, this ability temporarily grants you 30% of your maximum hit points for 20 seconds. After the effect expires, the hit points are lost."] = "啟動之後，使你暫時獲得30%的生命力，持續20秒。在效果解除之後，這些生命力會被扣除。"
L["When activated, this spell causes each of your Fire damage spell hits to increase your critical strike chance with Fire damage spells by 10%. This effect lasts until you have caused 3 critical strikes with Fire spells."] = "啟動之後，每一個火焰法術增加10%的火系法術致命一擊的機率。此效果持續到你的火系法術造成3次致命一擊後解除。"
L["When activated, this spell finishes the cooldown on all of your Frost spells."] = "啟動之後，使你所有冰霜法術的冷卻時間結束。"
L["When activated, your spells deal 30% more damage while costing 30% more mana to cast. This effect lasts 15 sec."] = "啟動之後，你的法術會造成30%的額外傷害，但同時也要消耗30%的額外法力才能施放。這個效果可以持續15秒。"
L["When active, 30% of all damage taken by the caster is taken by your Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter demon instead. In addition, both the demon and master will inflict 3% more damage. Lasts as long as the demon is active."] = "啟動之後，施法者所承受的傷害有30%被他:她;的小鬼、虛空行者、魅魔、夢魔或地獄犬分擔。另外，惡魔和其主人的任何攻擊所造成的傷害都提高3%。只要惡魔保持啟動狀態，該效果會一直持續。"
L["When used, adds 2 combo points to your target. You must add to or use those combo points within 10 sec or the combo points are lost."] = "使用此技能後，為你的當前目標增加2個連擊點數。你必須在10秒內消耗掉這些點數，否則它們就會消失。"
L["While Aspect of the Hawk is active, all normal ranged attacks have a 1% chance of increasing ranged attack speed by 30% for 12 sec."] = "在你的雄鷹守護作用期間，所有普通的遠程攻擊會有1%的機率使你的遠程攻擊速度提高30%，持續12秒。"
L["While affected by your Kidney Shot ability, the target receives an additional 3% damage from all sources."] = "當目標受到你的腎擊攻擊後，在腎擊的有效時間內所受到的傷害全部額外提高3%。"
L["While in Cat, Bear or Dire Bear Form, the Leader of the Pack increases ranged and melee critical chance of all party members within 45 yards by 3%."] = "在獵豹、熊或巨熊形態下，使半徑45碼範圍內的所有小隊成員的遠程和近戰攻擊打出致命一擊的機率提高3%。"
L["While your pet is active, you and your pet will regenerate 1% of total health every 10 sec."] = "只要你的寵物處於活動狀態，你與你的寵物都會每10秒恢復1%的生命力。"
L["You become encased in a block of ice, protecting you from all physical attacks and spells for 10 sec, but during that time you cannot attack, move or cast spells."] = "你被一道寒冰屏障所籠罩，在10秒內不會受到任何物理和法術傷害，但是在這期間你也無法攻擊、移動或施法。"
L["You retain up to 5 of your rage points when you change stances."] = "在改變姿態的時候可以保留最多5點怒氣。"
L["Your Fire and Frost spell criticals will refund 10% of their base mana cost."] = "使你的火焰和冰霜法術在造成致命一擊後將恢復10%點基礎法力消秏。"
L["Your Healing Wave spells have a 33% chance to increase the effect of subsequent Healing Wave spells on that target by 6% for 15 sec. This effect will stack up to 3 times."] = "你的治療波法術有33%的機率使目標在之後的治療波獲得額外提高6%的治療效果，持續15秒。最多可堆疊3次。"
L["Your Scorch spells have a 33% chance to cause your target to be vulnerable to Fire damage. This vulnerability increases the Fire damage dealt to your target by 3% and lasts 30 sec. Stacks up to 5 times."] = "使你的灼燒法術有33%的機率令目標更易受到火焰傷害，在其受到火焰系攻擊時承受的傷害提高3%，持續30秒。可疊加5次。"
L["Your Shadow Bolt critical strikes increase Shadow damage dealt to the target by 4% until 4 non-periodic damage sources are applied. Effect lasts a maximum of 12 sec."] = "在你的暗影箭對目標造成致命一擊後，你對其造成的接連4次的非持續性暗影傷害都將提高4%。效果最久持續12秒。"
L["Your Shadow damage spells have a 20% chance to cause your target to be vulnerable to Shadow damage. This vulnerability increases the Shadow damage dealt to your target by 3% and lasts 15 sec. Stacks up to 5 times."] = "你的暗影系傷害性法術有20%的機會使你的目標在受到暗影系攻擊時更脆弱，受到的傷害提高3%，持續15秒。此效果最多可疊加5次。"
L["Your critical strikes cause the opponent to bleed, dealing 20% of your melee weapon's average damage over 12 sec."] = "你的致命一擊導致目標流血，在12秒內造成相當於你的武器平均傷害20%的傷害。"
L["Your critical strikes from abilities that add combo points have a 20% chance to add an additional combo point."] = "如果你的某個可以增加連擊點數的技能造成了致命一擊，那麼它就有20%的機率增加一個額外的連擊點數。"
L["Your next Imp, Voidwalker, Succubus, Incubus, or Felhunter Summon spell has its casting time reduced by 5.5 sec and its Mana cost reduced by 50%."] = "你的下一個召喚小鬼、虛空行者、魅魔、夢魔或地獄獵犬法術施法時間減少5.5秒，法力消耗減少50%。"
L["Your offensive spell crits will increase your chance to get a critical strike with melee attacks by 3% for 10 sec."] = "使你的攻擊法術造成致命一擊會使你的物理攻擊造成致命一擊的機率提高3%，持續10秒。"
